Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不得不说，你跟我想象的不一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to say, you're not what I thought you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:06.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奥古斯特跟奎恩上床了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}August slept with Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:07.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她让我别告诉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She asked me not to say anything to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:10.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太对不起了，塞雷娜。你该知道真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so sorry, Serena. You deserve the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道吗？从现在起，我只跟瑞秋打交道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? From here on out, I'm only dealing with Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.45,0:00:16.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}效果特别好。她恨死我，却喜欢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It worked like a charm. She loathes me and loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:18.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等！谁会拿女人打赌啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa, whoa! Who bets on women?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开玩笑吧。我来这儿就为这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're kidding. It's the only reason I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:21.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我们在现实里认识……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If we met in the real world...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:23.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会要你的电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd get your number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后，呃，约你出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'd, um, ask you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:28.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对你严厉，是想帮你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm hard on you because I'm trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只是想越过所有人，直接攀上加里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're trying to cut to the front of the line with Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:33.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证，那不会有好结果。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I promise you, that is not going to end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:35.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想赢得真正的权力和尊重，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want to earn real power and respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:37.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就做独立自主的女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}be your own woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:38.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而不是当别人的婊子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not somebody else's bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.99,0:00:41.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，是这样。我要和奎恩一起提案一个节目\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, here's the deal. I'm pitching a show with Quinn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:44.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫《舞蹈护照》，你会是主角。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}called "Passport to Dance," and you're gonna be the star of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.74,0:00:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我答应，你会再给我带？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I say yes, you'll bring me more?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:48.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.35,0:00:50.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是瑞秋·戈德堡。天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Rachel Goldberg.Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.62,0:00:52.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底有没有想过你对我做的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ever even think about what you did to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.62,0:00:54.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我每次照镜子都会想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every time I look in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:56.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父亲那晚来了，把我狠狠揍了一顿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your father came that night, and he beat the crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:58.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.19,0:01:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸根本不知道发生了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father never even knew about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:02.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他当然知道。不是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course he did. It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.15,0:01:04.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我爸要是知道，他会跟我说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because if my father knew, he would've said something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:06.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是我爸知道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If my father knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:26.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:28.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在哪儿？你——你安全吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you? Are you -- Are you safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.35,0:01:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。我好几个月没你消息了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I haven't heard from you in months.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:32.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，听着，妈，我只是打来——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, look, Mom, I'm just calling --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个，呃——爸——爸在吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is, um -- Is -- Is Dad there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我一直打他手机，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I've been trying to call his cellphone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.79,0:01:37.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果都直接转语音信箱，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and it's just been going straight to voicemail, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。他老把手机弄丢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. He keeps losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.92,0:01:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可能都没充电。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Probably not even charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.93,0:01:43.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那怎样？现在想联系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, what? The only way to get ahold
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:45.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸只能通过你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of my father now is to go through you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:47.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有问题吗？他在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that a problem? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:49.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他，呃——他躺着呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's, um -- He's lying down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不舒服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊——因为他从来就没舒服过，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right -- because he never feels well, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:55.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这话什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:57.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道你一直让他嗑药，妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know you keep him drugged up, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:01:59.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就告诉他我打过电话，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you just tell him I called?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:02.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道是什么口信，怎么转告他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I can't give him a message if I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，口信就是“你女儿来过电话”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, the message is "Your daughter called."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:26.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开拍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And action.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:28.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道吗，我刚走进这座豪宅时，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, when I first walked into this mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.97,0:02:32.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}心里想：“天哪，这地方太完美了。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought to myself, "Man, this is perfect."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我灵光一现——砰！——就像脑袋里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And then it hit me like a -- Boom!   -- like a light bulb
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亮起了一个灯泡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}going off in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:39.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要一场仪式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need a ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.25,0:02:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要的是淘汰一个女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What we need is for a girl to get cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡！太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut! That was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:46.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.38,0:02:47.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，那我会用你的账号把那段发推特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, I'm gonna tweet that out from your account.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:49.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。我要把一段片段\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. I'm gonna put a clip
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发到Instagram上，让募捐会上的所有人都看到你有多\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on Instagram so that everyone at the fund-raiser sees how much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:57.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该拿艾美奖。我们——哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you deserve an Emmy.We -- Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.39,0:02:59.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干——你干什么？嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you do-- What are you doing? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:03:01.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，什么——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, what --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:03.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，对，你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, yeah, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.23,0:03:08.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，呃——我——只是，呃，我——严格来说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, uh -- I -- It's just that, uh, I -- Technically speaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对……你知道，我、我、我得靠我的蓝色小药丸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah....you know, I-I-I need my little blue buddies
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:12.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才能让下面有反应。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in order to get things going down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是针对你。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's nothing personal. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:17.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.11,0:03:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，呃，西蒙，西蒙，这儿。呃，跟我走走，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh, Simon, Simon, here. Uh, walk with me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？我要把你从瑞秋那边调走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's up?I am taking you off of Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在去做男嘉宾那边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're working with the guys now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.47,0:03:29.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？不行，奎恩，奎恩，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? No, Quinn, Quinn,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:32.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一直有实质进展，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we've been making real progress, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:33.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们继续做咨询很关键。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's crucial we continue our sessions here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:35.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mhn. Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:37.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我讲事实，而事实是——她反而更糟了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I deal in facts, and fact -- she's way worse
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.65,0:03:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自从开始跟你谈话以后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}since she started talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:40.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总会有起伏的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, there's always bumps in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这也是过程的一部分，对吧？你的任务是让她稳定下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's part of it, right?Your job was to stabilize her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我们正朝那个方向走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, and we're moving in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:47.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，她昨晚爬到我腿上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, she crawled into my laplast night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:49.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我们是不该有身体接触的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we don't touch each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:53.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以在我看来，你失败了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, as far as I'm concerned, you failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:00.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.11,0:04:02.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，今天我和杰伊要去洛杉矶提案一个节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, uh, Jay and I are headed to L.A. to pitch a show today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:04.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也就是说《永恒》就交给你们了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That means I am leaving "Everlasting" up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:05.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你来负责。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, you'll be running point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.55,0:04:07.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，呃，不行。其实我有点想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, um, no. Actually, I kind of wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟你谈请一天假的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to talk to you about taking a personal day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:11.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，今天不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, this is not the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.95,0:04:13.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我完全愿意负责\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I'd totally be up for running point
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:14.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果瑞秋不行的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if Rachel isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:16.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，太好了。不行。绝对不行，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, great. No. No way, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:17.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其是你之前对记者干的那件蠢事之后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not after the dumb-assery that you pulled with the reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:19.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被禁足了。留在别墅值班。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are grounded. House duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:24.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，她知道这次提案对我多重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Besides, she knows how important this pitch is for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:26.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧，瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you, Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:29.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，奎恩。我得跟你谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh, Quinn. I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:31.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的吊床出急事了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a hammock emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:35.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。来我办公室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, fine. In my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你搞什么鬼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, what the hell
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我员工面前跟我谈？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}were you thinking talking to me in front of my staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:41.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，抱歉，但我们有麻烦了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I'm sorry, but we've got a problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:43.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞蕾娜知道了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:45.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上次仪式上她对我冷若冰霜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was ice cold to me at the last ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那也太无聊太可悲了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's so boring and so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:48.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，这事很严重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, this is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.81,0:04:52.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}局面是你造成的，你得解决。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You created the situation, so you need to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:55.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。我们亲热的时候，我都没注意到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. I didn't notice those brass balls
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:04:58.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你胆子这么大，可现在……就在眼前。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when we were getting nasty, and yet...there they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:00.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，通常不会闹到这一步，但……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, normally it wouldn't come to this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:04.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果非得走性骚扰这条路，我会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if I have to go down the sexual harassment route, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？我只是说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me? I'm just saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:11.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我以任何方式被曝光，我就曝光你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if I get outed in any way, then I out you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:12.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.53,0:05:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会摆平的。很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will shut it down. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟奎恩谈了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you talk to Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:20.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈什么？她想让我们别再合作了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About what? She wants us to stop working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.41,0:05:22.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她让我去跟男嘉宾。好，行吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's putting me on the guys.Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.23,0:05:24.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，这说得通。不，说不通。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that makes sense.No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:26.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们随时被大概27台摄像机对着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's, like, 27 cameras pointed at them at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.89,0:05:28.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不担心男嘉宾。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not worried about the guys.Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:30.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我担心的是你。哦，不，听着，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm worried about you.Oh, no, listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:31.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不用。瑞秋。说真的，我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you don't have to be. Rachel.Seriously, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿。怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey, hey, hey. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:37.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你来找我，说了件很沉重的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the one who came to me with a pretty heavy admission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.55,0:05:39.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，我知道。你在这事上帮了大忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I know. And you have been super helpful about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.47,0:05:43.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很感激。我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really appreciate it. I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.43,0:05:45.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我只是自己在处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I'm just handling it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:47.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那到底是什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.26,0:05:49.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋！来我办公室。马上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel! In my office. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:50.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:52.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，听着，我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, look, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:05:59.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你把西蒙从我这儿调走了，但——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know you took Simon off me, but --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。你的“约会”变得更复杂了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Your "date" just got more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:05.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿着这个。我们必须毁掉奥古斯特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take this. We have to destroy August.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他以为他能威胁我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He thinks he can threaten me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:09.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我们不跟恐怖分子谈判。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, we do not negotiate with terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，奎恩，发生了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Quinn, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:13.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你在他搞垮我之前搞垮他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to take him down before he takes me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:15.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确保没人相信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make sure that no one believes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.03,0:06:18.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他嘴里说出的任何一个字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a word that comes out of his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:22.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天，我们的女嘉宾将勇闯荒野。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Today, our Suitress will forge into the wilderness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:25.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在小径尽头，塞蕾娜将选出\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And at the end of the trail, Serena will select
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:28.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她最信任的那个男人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the one man that she trusts the most
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.52,0:06:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}参加本季首次过夜约会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for our very first overnight date of the season
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:34.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我们著名的约会小屋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in our famous Date Cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。当然会有挑战——导航、\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.There will be challenges, of course -- of navigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.53,0:06:38.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}力量……我现在都看不下去奥古斯特的那张脸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}strength...I can't even stand to look at August's face right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想淘汰他，但需要一个借口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to cut him, but I need an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.66,0:06:42.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't even worry about it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:47.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}由护林员帕姆带你们穿越荒野。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To help guide you through the wild is Ranger Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:50.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:52.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，帕姆。嘿，帕姆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Pam.Hey, Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.15,0:06:54.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们的第一个挑战是让塞蕾娜安全穿过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your first challenge is to get Serena safely across
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:56.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这条湍急的河流。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this raging river.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:57.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}护林员帕姆？我是说，那些\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ranger Pam? I mean, those
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:06:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本该是我的台词，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}were supposed to be my lines, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:01.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各就各位！预备！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On your marks! Get set!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.55,0:07:03.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.99,0:07:06.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！奥古斯特，你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah!August, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这也是一种办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.43,0:07:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩·金和杰·卡特来见加里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn King and Jay Carter to see Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:12.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在等我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's expecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:14.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，请坐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:16.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。那么，你们有什么想法？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.So, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:17.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们想再过一遍，还是……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to run it through one more time, or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。闭上嘴，跟着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Just keep your mouth shut and follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:21.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.05,0:07:26.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直接踩坑里了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stomped right into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:30.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想趁现在跟你谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, I wanted a chance to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.54,0:07:32.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:35.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞蕾娜，我真的很努力。是吗？那就别努力了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena, I'm really trying.Yeah? Well, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加油，欧文！嘿，耶！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Owen!Hey, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能行！加油，你可以的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got this!Come on, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:42.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.51,0:07:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加油，伙计们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:48.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他现在可以见你们了。哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll see you now.Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.69,0:07:55.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不是先来的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Weren't we here first?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.91,0:07:58.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你告诉他们我们到了，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You told them we were here, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:07:59.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:03.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}需要帮忙吗？我来帮你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you need some help? Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:08.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好。哥们，真有你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well done. Good on you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真让人佩服。啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very impressive. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:12.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，现在是冲向约会小屋的比赛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, now it's the race to the Date Cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:14.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正东方向！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Due East!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:15.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在跑起来了。太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now we're running. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他挺可爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:21.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩要再来瓶水吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Would you two like another water?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经快憋不住了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am about to piss myself as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:26.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有问题吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:28.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证他们马上就来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure they'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:32.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，童子军欧文领先了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Owen the boy scout's in the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:35.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜你，欧文。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations, Owen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.21,0:08:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我停下来摘了些野花。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I stopped to pick some wildflowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.65,0:08:38.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这是给你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. That's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:41.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你，美人。干得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, gorgeous.Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.13,0:08:42.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还好吗，贾斯珀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay, Jasper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:45.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。只是有点——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. Just a coup--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.57,0:08:47.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞雷娜，你决定好过夜人选了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena, have you made your decision for the overnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:49.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}决定了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:53.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你们展现了非常惊人的生存技能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, you all showed very impressive survival skills
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:55.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天，尤其是你，欧文。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}today, especially you, Owen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.27,0:08:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，我最信任的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, the person that I would trust most
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:09:00.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}陪我度过今晚的是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}through the night is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:04.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贾斯珀。什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jasper. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:06.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？是的。我一向偏爱弱者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?Yeah. I'm a sucker for an underdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。那么，贾斯珀赢得了约会，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great.Well, Jasper won the date,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:11.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以其余各位先生会留在这里烤小香肠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so the rest of you gentlemen will be here roasting wienies
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:13.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喝啤酒、开篝火晚会！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and drinking beer and having a bonfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.81,0:09:16.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你看起来是这群人里最壮的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you look like the brawn of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:17.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能来帮我劈点柴生火吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you come and help me split some wood for the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:20.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，好，没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, yeah, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:22.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乡间别墅？是的，很漂亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Country house?Yes. It's gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概从18世纪起就归我们家了，我想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's been in the family since, like, the 1700s, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。杰瑞米，杰瑞米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Jeremy, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:30.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，伙计们，啤酒和香肠这边走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, guys, beers and wienies this-a-way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.66,0:09:33.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啤酒和香肠。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beers and wienies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.18,0:09:34.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哇。  -别这样，奥古斯特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa.Pam: Come on, August.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:37.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。等等。到底搞什么鬼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.Hang on.What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:40.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞雷娜！我完全不知道，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena! I have no idea, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她突然扑上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She just jumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:42.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种事好像总发生在你身上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That seems to keep happening to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:44.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不。你得相信我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no. You've got to believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:45.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我甚至觉得她根本不是真正的护林员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even think she's a real Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:47.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发誓。我没有理由相信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I swear.I have no reason to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:48.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你嘴里说出的任何一个字，奥古斯特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a word that comes out of your mouth, August.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:51.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很抱歉，塞雷娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so sorry, Serena.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:53.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这太恶劣了。别担心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is just appalling.Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.11,0:09:54.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:10:00.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，这整件事是瑞秋安排的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh my God, did Rachel just set that whole thing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:04.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个“护林员”大概是从克雷格列表上找的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Probably got that "Ranger" off of Craigslist
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.52,0:10:06.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在开车过来的路上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on the drive over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:08.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是这档节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。你是查理，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. You're Charlie right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:17.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.83,0:10:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好。我要是你，就会离那个远点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. I'd -- I'd stay away from that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。我不是想惹麻烦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. I'm not trying to cause a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:23.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，听着，我不是嫉妒什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, look, I'm not jealous or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是，呃，想帮姐妹一把。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just, uh, trying to help a sister out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:34.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了，真的，真的很棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was great, really, really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:39.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:42.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系。加里那边有事拖长了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No problem.Gary had a thing which went long,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:45.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以今天就是不行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and it's just not gonna happen today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.69,0:10:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在开玩笑吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:49.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。但好消息是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. But here's the good news --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:52.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的助手莱尼一定会听你们的提案\N{\rEN\blur0.8}his associate Lenny will absolutely hear your pitch
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你们愿意的话。呃，这个——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you would like.Uh, well --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:56.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:58.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收拾你的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:11:03.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为这个电视网赚了数亿美元。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have made this network hundreds of millions of dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.58,0:11:06.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而加里连尊重我到出席提案会都做不到？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Gary can't respect me enough to show up for a pitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:08.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……听着，我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um... look, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:10.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是——不。你告诉加里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just --No. You tell Gary
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:12.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在他有空见我之前，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that until he has time for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.19,0:11:14.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》正式停拍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Everlasting" is officially shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:16.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，我——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, I-I --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.33,0:11:20.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。因为，把这个记下来，一字一句地——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Because, and write this down, word for word --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:26.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些狗屎我绝不会忍。就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is some shit I will not eat. Period.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.90,0:11:28.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，杰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:31.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:40.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难以置信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:41.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们还真是拼了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're really going for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:43.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:44.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？我——我这儿信号很差。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you saying? I-I get terrible service here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:49.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说了停拍！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I said to shut it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.19,0:11:51.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说把摄像机关了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm saying cut the cameras!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:53.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把演员带回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring the cast home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，我们约会正进行到一半。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, we're in the middle of the date.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:57.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，她真的就在里面和贾斯珀热吻，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, she's like literally in there making out with Jasper,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.28,0:11:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且你得看看我拍到奥古斯特的什么东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you have got to see what I've got on August.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:02.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管。照做！停掉！等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do not care. Do it! Pull the plug!Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.42,0:12:03.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，伙计们，收工了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, that's a wrap, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.81,0:12:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停！停！停！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut! Cut! Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:06.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们停拍了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're pulling the plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.94,0:12:08.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}认真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:11.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回家去。该死。我错过电话了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go home.Shit. I missed the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:12.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是认真的。回家去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm serious. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.73,0:12:14.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊，那边到底怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison, what the hell is going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:15.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们停拍了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:17.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对奎恩已经忍无可忍了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is the last straw with Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:19.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听见了吗？有人要倒霉了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You hear me? Heads are gonna roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.35,0:12:21.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都停下工作！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop working!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:24.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你把所有忠于奎恩的人列个名单\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to make a list of all the people loyal to Quinn
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:26.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样我可以先开除他们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I can fire them first!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:27.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那节目怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what's going to happen to the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.75,0:12:29.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那破节目自己都能做出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That stupid show could make itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:31.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，其实这比看起来要复杂一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, it's actually a little more complicated than it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.32,0:12:33.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请集中注意力，好吗？我需要你帮我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please focus, all right? I need you to help me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有这边的交接。天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with the transition here. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.93,0:12:36.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是要升我当剧集主管吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you promoting me to Showrunner?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，当然不是。我要从竞技类节目里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, no. I'm gonna get one of the guys
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:39.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挖个人来做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}from the competition shows to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。我是说，这样最合理，因为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. I mean, I guess that makes the most sense since
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:43.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上就要忙着《#成年生活》了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna be so busy with "Hashtag Adulting" soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.85,0:12:46.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}忙什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的试播剧。哦。对。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My pilot. Oh. Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.77,0:12:50.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，那绝对还在计划里，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honey, that is definitely still in the mix, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:55.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但听我说。系好安全带，因为这是战争。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But listen to me. Buckle your seatbelt because this is war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:06.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，呃，我们因为一些技术问题停拍了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, uh, we are shut down due to some technical difficulties.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.44,0:13:07.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们就待在房间里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You guys will just be confined to your rooms
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:10.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我们来叫你们。我就想，“不行。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}until we come get you.I am just like, "Mnh-mnh."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位，说晚安吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys, let's just say good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:17.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚安。晚安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good night. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.97,0:13:23.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，你，呃——你设计了奥古斯特\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you, uh -- you set up August
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:25.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好让我有正当理由淘汰他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I'd have a legitimate reason to cut him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:27.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无可奉告。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No comment. Mm.
