Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:24.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:28.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。爸，呃……嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Dad, um... Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:29.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直在联系你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been trying to reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我需要跟你谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:33.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.28,0:20:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。进来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.37,0:20:39.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.59,0:20:46.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可是个大金矿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1This is the mother lode.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.03,0:20:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很糟，对吧？真的太糟了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's bad, right?It's so, so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.86,0:20:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明白如果我们这么做，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do understand that if we do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:58.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的试播集就完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}your pilot is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:00.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加里绝不会要它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gary is never picking it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.65,0:21:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不止一个试播集。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm more than one pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.52,0:21:06.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我赌你。我要你也赌我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm betting on you. I want you to bet on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:10.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:13.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就打电话吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then make the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.89,0:21:23.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，加里。对，她在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Gary. Yeah, she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:25.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。她一点都没怀疑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. She doesn't suspect a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。一小时后见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great. I'll see you in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.50,0:21:31.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.73,0:21:34.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该生气的人是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm the one that should be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.47,0:21:36.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天我赢下了每一个破挑战，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I killed every stupid challenge today,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果塞蕾娜还是跟那个华尔街混蛋在一起了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Serena still ended up with that Wall Street douchebag
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他来这儿只是为了赢赌局。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who's just here to collect on a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.60,0:21:43.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赌局？你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bet? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.39,0:21:45.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贾斯珀是来赢赌局的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jasper's here on a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:48.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果他是第一个跟塞蕾娜上床的人，就能拿到40万美元。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If he's the first one to sleep with Serena, he gets $400,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.31,0:21:50.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在开玩笑吧。还有谁知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're kidding me. Well, who else knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.66,0:21:54.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，几个男的，还有一些制片人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, handful of the guys, some producers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.27,0:21:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸，我们真的得谈谈这件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad, we really do need to talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.84,0:21:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你知道吗？我给你做个三明治吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you know what? I'm just gonna make you a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.45,0:21:59.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我们还有——如果你一直都知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we got some --If you knew this whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.88,0:22:01.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不说点什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why didn't you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.14,0:22:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？为什么不做点什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm? Why didn't you do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.15,0:22:07.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:12.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我讨厌你妈做的那份工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hated the work your mother was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.42,0:22:15.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也讨厌她居然在家里做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I hated the fact she was doing it in our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.69,0:22:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，出事那天，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, the day it happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.69,0:22:27.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你生病请假在家，而且，呃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you were home from school, sick, and, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.35,0:22:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你妈说她必须取消。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told your mother she had to cancel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:32.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说如果付账单的人不是我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She said if I wasn't paying the bills,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.83,0:22:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就轮不到我做决定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then it wasn't my place to make that call.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:37.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。所以她把你阉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. So she cut off your balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.40,0:22:45.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去那家伙家里了，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I went to the guy's house, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.19,0:22:48.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把他狠狠揍了一顿。然后我真想杀了他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I kicked the crap out of him. Then I was ready to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:50.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也准备报警了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I was also ready to call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.93,0:22:53.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你为什么没报？因为你妈——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why didn't you do that?Because your mother --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.11,0:22:54.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她一直说这样对你最好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She just kept saying it would be the best for you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.02,0:22:57.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不让你的名字在法庭上被拖来拖去，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not to have your name dragged through the courts,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.07,0:23:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不让全世界知道——因为她是个反社会，爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not to have the world know about --'Cause she's a sociopath, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.82,0:23:05.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞蕾娜，我需要你知道，我觉得你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena, I need you to know that I think you are
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.95,0:23:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简直……太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just...incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.60,0:23:12.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从第一晚起就这么觉得。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have, from the first night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.39,0:23:15.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，说来好笑。通常遇到你这种男人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, it's funny. Usually with guys like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.87,0:23:19.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一个字都不会信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't trust a word that came out of your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.48,0:23:24.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但不知为什么，我信你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But for some reason, I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.50,0:23:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道该怎么办。我——我觉得很无助。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know what to do. And I-I felt helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.72,0:23:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得无助？我是说，真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Youfelt helpless? I mean, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:41.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你很痛苦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew you were in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.55,0:23:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说她会处理。不，爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She said she was handling it.No, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.42,0:23:47.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她给我灌了一堆药！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was medicating the shit out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.73,0:23:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.56,0:23:56.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道作为父亲、作为男人，我失败了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew I had failed as a father, as a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.87,0:24:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发现自己站在桥顶，往下看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I found myself on the top of a bridge, looking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.53,0:24:08.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我想：“有什么意义？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I thought, "What's the point?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.58,0:24:10.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我连自己的女儿都保护不了，我真的觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I can't protect my own daughter, I honestly thought
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.27,0:24:13.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有我你会过得更好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you'd be better off without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.50,0:24:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后你妈——嗯，她找到我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then your mother -- Well, she got to me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.02,0:24:21.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正好及时，瑞秋，真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just in time, Rach, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.02,0:24:28.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她给我用了锂盐。然后……我就平静下来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And she put on lithium. And...it calmed me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.12,0:24:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸，那只是让你麻木了。不，瑞秋，我需要它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad, it numbed you out.No, Rach, I needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.12,0:24:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}信不信由你，是你妈救了我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Believe it or not, your mom saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.17,0:24:40.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，爸，她只是让你不再感受、不再开口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Dad, she just got you to stop feeling and talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.26,0:24:43.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对我，你知道，对任何人都一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To me, you know, to, like, anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.74,0:24:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个女人就是个怪物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The woman is a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.01,0:24:50.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃，真的很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm, like, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.18,0:24:52.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没什么好抱歉的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have nothing to be sorry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.10,0:24:55.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我有。我撒了谎。我跟那个人说我17岁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I do. I lied. I told the guy that I was 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.06,0:25:02.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，别说了！他那样对你，没有任何借口！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, stop! There is no excuse for what he did to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.11,0:25:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完全没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}None.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.50,0:25:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸，我们得把你弄出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad, we have to get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.72,0:25:10.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}必须走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.46,0:25:12.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，问题在她。问题不在你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, the problem is her. The problem is not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.38,0:25:15.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没有任何问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is nothing wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.99,0:25:17.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.46,0:25:48.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只是，呃——我们只是要——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're just, um -- We're just gonna --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.63,0:25:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。别担心，爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no. Don't worry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.68,0:25:52.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完全不用担心。我来处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't even worry about it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.33,0:25:54.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就继续——把东西搬上车，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just keep -- Just put the stuff in the truck, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.03,0:25:57.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。你拿得动吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. You got this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.03,0:26:00.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.52,0:26:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到底怎么回事？我只是把我爸从他的狱卒身边带走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell's going on?I'm just getting my father away from his jailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.21,0:26:05.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你跟着我们，我就去报警。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if you follow us, I'm gonna go to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.61,0:26:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿萨，你不能这么做。我会把一切都告诉他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Asa, you can't do this.And I'm gonna tell them everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.04,0:26:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿萨，你知道的。你个没有道德的神经病。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Asa, you know this.You are an unethical psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.96,0:26:10.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸，上车。她不知道自己在说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad, get in the car.She doesn't know what she's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.09,0:26:11.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了。她是我的孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please. She's my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.35,0:26:12.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不，求你别走。不。住手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, please don't go.No. Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.66,0:26:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了。阿萨！别过来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please. Asa!Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.48,0:26:15.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿萨，求你别走！停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Asa, please don't go!Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.84,0:26:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停下！你停下！你住手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop! You stop!You stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:19.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？这一切今天到此为止。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? This all stops, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.71,0:26:21.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，阿萨，求你了。这一切今天结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Asa, please.This all ends today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.28,0:26:22.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你别走。求你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please don't go. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.02,0:26:25.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿萨，求你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Asa, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.70,0:26:52.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请大家，所有人，包括剧组人员，都到大房间集合。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1please, everybody,erybody gatcrew included? great room,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.83,0:26:54.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐吧，各位。来吧，大家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have a seat, guys.Come on, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.57,0:26:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会非常激动人心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is gonna be very exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.48,0:26:59.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我警告过你，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I warned you, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.36,0:27:03.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我很高兴大家都在，因为现在就是关键时刻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I'm glad everyone's here because this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.19,0:27:06.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被解雇了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.80,0:27:09.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。好啊，那让我告诉你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh.Yeah, now let me tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.72,0:27:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接下来会怎样。其实，让我告诉你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what's gonna happen.Actually, let me tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.59,0:27:14.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接下来会怎样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.68,0:27:16.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们要拿下《舞蹈护照》\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna pick up "Passport to Dance"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.16,0:27:17.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直接预订成剧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}straight to series.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.85,0:27:20.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还要给我们一个绝佳的黄金时段。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're gonna give us a primo prime-time slot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.25,0:27:22.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我在想周日晚上8点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I'm thinking Sundays at 8:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.99,0:27:24.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底在说什么鬼话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What in the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.95,0:27:27.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在说你被解雇了——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am talking about you being fired --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.95,0:27:30.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}登上《综艺》头版，法务会计调查，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}front page of Variety, forensic accounting,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.69,0:27:34.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被永远赶出好莱坞的那种解雇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}kicked out of Hollywood forever kind of fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.31,0:27:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们两个白痴到底懂什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell do you two idiots know
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.96,0:27:42.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于法务会计？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about forensic accounting?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.88,0:27:46.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你一直藏着《永恒》的国际收益——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know that you've been hiding "Everlasting's" international profits --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.88,0:27:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从我和切特这里偷走1800万美元——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}stealing $18 million from me and Chet --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.93,0:27:53.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来替你其他烂节目的亏损擦屁股。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to cover your own ass on losses on your other pathetic shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.15,0:27:55.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些都是毫无证据的胡乱指控。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These are wild accusations without any proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.98,0:27:58.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以告你诽谤。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could have you sued for slander.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.11,0:27:59.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你大概就不该把这一切都\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, then you probably shouldn't have put it all
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.94,0:28:02.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}写进邮件里，加里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in an e-mail, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.94,0:28:04.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是法律文件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a legal document.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.99,0:28:08.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能。我有安全服务器。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's impossible. I have a secure server.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.04,0:28:11.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都这么干。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.21,0:28:13.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，这就像制片厂体系的秘密握手礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, it's like a studio system secret handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.47,0:28:15.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但以后不会了，加里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But not any more, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.43,0:28:19.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，你得给我滚远点，别再烦我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you are going to get the hell off my back
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.48,0:28:22.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一季剩下的时间，给我全权处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for the rest of the season. Carte blanche.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.14,0:28:24.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我们可以从《舞蹈护照》开始，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then we can start with "Passport to Dance,"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.27,0:28:27.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我希望有四部剧在积极推进\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I'd like to have four shows in active development
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.97,0:28:29.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在今年年底之前。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}by the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.71,0:28:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至于你曾经暗示我是个干瘪的老太婆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And as far as ever implying that I am a dried-up hag
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.41,0:28:37.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为年纪大了被这个行业淘汰——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}aging my way out of the industry --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.24,0:28:39.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好别再讲那套说辞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you might want to drop that narrative
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.28,0:28:43.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}承认我现在把你拿捏得死死的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and admit that I own your ass now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.38,0:28:48.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你要我说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What am I supposed to say to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.07,0:28:50.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're supposed to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.34,0:28:54.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“谢谢你给我这个机会，奎恩。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Thank you for the opportunity, Quinn."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.43,0:29:00.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是认真的，加里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm serious, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.66,0:29:14.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你给我这个机会，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for the opportunity, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.45,0:29:18.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.37,0:29:23.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她真是个狠角色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's such a ball-buster.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.94,0:29:25.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她一直都这么狠，还是变得更狠了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Has she always been this bad or has she gotten worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.98,0:29:28.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比以前狠多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Much, much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.94,0:29:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我们真得走了，如果想赶上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, we should really get going if we want to make
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.72,0:29:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}法国洗衣房餐厅的预订。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that French Laundry reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.16,0:29:35.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}法国洗衣房餐厅的预订。哦，对对对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The French Laundry reservation.Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.77,0:29:37.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你知道吗？你先去，我在那儿跟你碰头？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, you know what? Why don't you go ahead and I'll meet you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.64,0:29:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得处理点事。一些娱乐圈的事。哦，娱乐圈的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I gotta do some stuff. Some show-biz stuff.Oh. Show-biz stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.56,0:29:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。行。再见，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. All right. Bye, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.13,0:29:44.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.48,0:29:49.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.31,0:29:53.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚才对加里做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What you just did with Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.53,0:29:58.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在为你硬得不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so hard for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.75,0:30:00.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我简直硬得像石头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm, like, rock hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.62,0:30:03.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摸摸看。不。行了，拜托，切特。真恶心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Feel this.No. Okay. Come on, Chet. That's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.10,0:30:04.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没吃药。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.02,0:30:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我多年没这么硬过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't been this hard for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.24,0:30:08.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真为你高兴，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.15,0:30:10.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但那是克丽丝托现在的活儿，不是我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But that is Crystal's job now, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.68,0:30:12.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在需要你，奎恩。什么？不行。什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you right now, Quinn.What? No. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.90,0:30:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不不。切特，从我身上下去，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no. Chet, get off of me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.60,0:30:19.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回家操你的充气娃娃去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go home and screw your blow-up doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.95,0:30:28.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想你，奎妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I miss you, Quinnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.78,0:30:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很想你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I miss you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.53,0:30:37.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.27,0:30:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你选了省事的那条路。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you chose easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.67,0:30:49.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.68,0:30:57.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让我拿那个吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want me to take that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.81,0:30:59.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不，我能拿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no. I can carry it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.55,0:31:00.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。我们这就过去——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.We're just gonna head over --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.95,0:31:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你在里面干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, what are you doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.16,0:31:04.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我正找你呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. I was just looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.95,0:31:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直很担心。停拍之后就没见过你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was worried. I hadn't seen you since the shutdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.39,0:31:11.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，我是西蒙医生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, I'm Dr. Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.91,0:31:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，这是我父亲，阿萨·戈德堡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, this is my father, Asa Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.96,0:31:18.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴认识您，先生。我也很高兴认识你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pleased to meet you, sir.Nice to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.62,0:31:22.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，呃，爸，你先进去吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, uh, Pop, why don't you head on in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.18,0:31:23.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进这里？对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In here? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.45,0:31:25.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.14,0:31:28.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里有什么打算，瑞秋？呃，很晚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the plan here, Rachel?Uh, well, it's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.19,0:31:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们就先待着，等我想好下一步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So we're gonna camp out till I figure out my next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.37,0:31:32.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。我们暂住这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. We're camping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.72,0:31:34.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.33,0:31:36.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？这是什么？你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?What is this? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.98,0:31:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰伊，瑞秋，我们需要你们马上到片场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay, Rachel, we need you on set right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.16,0:31:43.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.55,0:31:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能，呃——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you, um --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.21,0:31:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能不能就……在这儿待一会儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you just, like, stay here for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.30,0:31:50.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就一小会儿。就……看着他点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just for a little bit. Just, like, keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.43,0:31:53.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会尽快回来。“看着他点”？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be back as soon as I can.An "eye on him?"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.48,0:31:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，我这是要掺和进什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, what am I walking into here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.04,0:31:56.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.83,0:31:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你看，你说过想帮我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, look, you said you wanted to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.57,0:32:01.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是我需要的帮忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, this is the help I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.31,0:32:04.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，爸，我马上回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Pop, I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.88,0:32:06.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.67,0:32:16.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿萨。你怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Asa. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.63,0:32:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}樱花很爷们儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cherry blossoms aremanly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.02,0:32:20.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还想要。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want more. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.50,0:32:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩。怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.42,0:32:23.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，能再拿些樱花来吗……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, can we get some more cherry blossoms...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.55,0:32:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把节目卖出去了。直接整季预订。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We sold our show. Straight to series.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.51,0:32:27.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？怎么做到的？周日八点档。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? How?Sundays at 8:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.25,0:32:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你认真的？！恭喜你，搭档。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you serious?!Congratulations, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.08,0:32:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伙计们，我们又回来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we are back in business, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.08,0:32:34.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要塞蕾娜二十分钟内准备好到片场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need Serena ready and on set in 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.21,0:32:35.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.43,0:32:39.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。奥古斯特，你在这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa. August, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.39,0:32:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞蕾娜，求你了，听我说一句。滚出我的房间！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena, please, just hear me out for a second.Get out of my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.00,0:32:42.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，求你就给我一分钟，求你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, just please just give me one minute, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.48,0:32:44.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我知道我搞砸得离谱……是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I know I screwed up colossally... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.70,0:32:46.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但你得知道，那个护林员的事——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but you need to know the thing with the ranger --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.75,0:32:47.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是被设局的，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that was set up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.92,0:32:49.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是吗？对。奎恩也是设局吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah?Yes. Was Quinn a setup, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.71,0:32:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……是奎恩逼我的，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... Quinn cornered me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.14,0:32:55.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也明白今晚我会被淘汰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I understand I'm getting cut tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.67,0:32:58.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系，但我真的——我只是想来道别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's okay, but I really -- I just wanted to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.80,0:33:01.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我想确保你掌握\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I wanted to make sure that you have
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.41,0:33:03.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做决定所需的所有信息\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all the information you need to make decisions
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.63,0:33:05.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正能让你幸福的决定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that are actually gonna make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.85,0:33:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.72,0:33:10.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贾斯珀是冲着赌约来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jasper's here on a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.03,0:33:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果他是第一个跟你上床的人，就能拿到四十万美元。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He gets $400,000 if he's the first one to sleep with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.60,0:33:17.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。你他妈——不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. You're f-- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.47,0:33:19.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.09,0:33:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.79,0:33:30.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生们，今天在荒野里真是惊心动魄，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gentlemen, what a harrowing day in the wilderness,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.10,0:33:33.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们中的一个人被抓到背叛我们的女嘉宾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when one of our own was caught betraying our Suitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.18,0:33:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格雷厄姆，拜托——别说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Graham, just please -- just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.36,0:33:37.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？我有件事要宣布。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?I have an announcement to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.58,0:33:39.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mnh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.15,0:33:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不会是一场普通的仪式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This isn't gonna be a normal ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.54,0:33:44.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从现在起，唯一的规则\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From this moment forward, the only rules
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.63,0:33:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是我定的规则。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}are the rules that I make.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.72,0:33:48.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉过你们，我是认真的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you that I was serious
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.90,0:33:51.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想找一个共度余生的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about finding someone to spend the rest of my life with.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.12,0:33:54.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你们很多人似乎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it seems like many of you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.73,0:34:01.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这当成一场病态又残忍的游戏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}are treating this like a sick and cruel game.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.47,0:34:04.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道谁在撒谎，谁说的是真话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know who's lying or who's telling the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.82,0:34:08.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我决定今晚不淘汰任何人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I've decided that I'm not cutting any of you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.44,0:34:10.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？什——呃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Wha-- Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.66,0:34:12.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这姑娘真让我头疼。我太崩溃了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This girl is a pain in my ass. I'm too overwhelmed
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.57,0:34:15.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又气疯了，我要去睡了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and pissed off and I am going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.53,0:34:20.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你就这样保住了自己，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So that's how you saved your ass, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.62,0:34:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有权知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She had the right to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.28,0:34:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。而且你得当那个告诉她的英雄，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. And you had to be the hero to tell her, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.80,0:34:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞蕾娜！停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.24,0:34:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底以为自己在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.50,0:34:30.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说了——去睡觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you -- going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.68,0:34:33.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，你必须淘汰一个人，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you have to cut someone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.16,0:34:36.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}合同、日程和预算\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are contracts and schedules and budgets
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.16,0:34:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全都是基于这个淘汰机制。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all based on this elimination structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.16,0:34:40.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是吗？除非你想把手伸进我屁股里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah? Well, unless you want to put your hand up my ass
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.47,0:34:42.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后操控我的嘴，那不可能。别诱惑我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and puppet my mouth, it's not happening.Don't tempt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.69,0:34:45.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，塞雷娜。等等。我真的需要跟你谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, Serena. Wait. I really need to speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.13,0:34:47.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，什么，关于那个赌？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, what, about the bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.48,0:34:48.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我全都知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I know all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.91,0:34:51.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便说一句，你输了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the way, you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.09,0:34:54.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一晚我就跟那个骑师睡了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I slept with the jockey night one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.66,0:34:59.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.66,0:35:04.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚听到他蛋蛋掉下来的声音了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you just hear his balls drop?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.19,0:35:06.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听到了。听到小小的“叮叮”声。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did. I heard a little "clink, clink."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.10,0:35:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.02,0:35:15.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是——啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1 It is -- Ah!h!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.98,0:35:18.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.33,0:35:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敬杰伊·巴塞洛缪·卡特，从今天起，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To Jay Bartholomew Carter, who, as of today,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.34,0:35:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他有了自己的电视节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}has his very own television show.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.56,0:35:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错！鼓掌，鼓掌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right! Applause, applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.65,0:35:31.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.30,0:35:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真高兴你没有私生活，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so glad that you don't have a life
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.48,0:35:36.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为接下来这两年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because you are going to be sleeping at work
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.35,0:35:37.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你都得睡在公司。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for the next two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.83,0:35:40.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干杯！哇呼！太棒了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cheers. Whoo-hoo! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.53,0:35:42.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干杯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.75,0:35:45.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唔。你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.23,0:35:47.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们好久没跳过舞了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We haven't been dancing in forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.23,0:35:51.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要不我们把这场派对搬到夜店去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So what do you say that we take this party to the club?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.50,0:35:53.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得回家了，奎恩。抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to get going home, Quinn. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.24,0:35:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人给我做晚饭呢。怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got someone cooking me dinner. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.85,0:35:57.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，而且我还有一堆文件要，呃——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, and I-I have all of this paperwork that I, like --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.89,0:36:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你们。恭喜。真为你们高兴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you guys. Congratulations. Super happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.29,0:36:03.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜大家！谢谢你们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mazel tov to everybody!And thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.20,0:36:04.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.51,0:36:10.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我倒是愿意去夜店哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd be down to go to the cluuuub.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.73,0:36:14.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我改主意了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.17,0:36:17.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过谢谢你今天帮忙，麦迪逊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But thank you for today, Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.26,0:36:19.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你选对了阵营。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You picked the right team.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.35,0:36:21.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.40,0:36:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，不行。太快了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, no. Too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.88,0:36:27.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.01,0:36:30.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，抱歉。我就是好奇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, you know, I'm sorry. I'm just curious, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.10,0:36:34.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是你去夜店，会去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you were going to go to a club, where would you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.80,0:36:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道，也许Vixen？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, maybe Vixen?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.02,0:36:40.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，酷。瑞秋：嘿，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, cool.Rachel: Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.24,0:36:42.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.07,0:36:44.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最近怎么样？挺好的。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's it going?Good. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.07,0:36:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这位朋友西蒙医生，问题可真多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your friend, Dr. Simon here, is very inquisitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.38,0:36:48.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.16,0:36:54.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能，呃，跟你到外面说两句吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I, uh, speak with you outside for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.47,0:36:55.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.35,0:37:03.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.18,0:37:06.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说要给你爸戒掉锂盐，这不可能是认真的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You cannot be serious about weaning your dad off of lithium
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.31,0:37:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他一个人在器材车里戒。好吧，听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}here on his own in a grip truck. Okay, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.44,0:37:11.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我，他根本就不该吃那些药，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me, he should have never been on those meds
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.79,0:37:14.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从一开始就不该。我可以向你保证，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the first place. I can promise you that
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.19,0:37:16.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的抑郁是环境造成的，不是生理上的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}his depression is situational. It is not chemical.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.67,0:37:19.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些可能都没错，但戒断锂盐——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that could all be true, but withdrawing from lithium --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.54,0:37:21.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可不是开玩笑的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.11,0:37:23.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会有震颤、流感症状、躁狂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're talking tremors, flu symptoms, mania.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.33,0:37:25.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白。所以我特意把他带来——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand. That's exactly why I have him here --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.11,0:37:26.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样我能盯着他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I can keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.85,0:37:29.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且这儿有24小时医护人员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And besides, there's a medic 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.07,0:37:31.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋——不，听我说，我自己试过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel --No, listen, I've done this for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.90,0:37:34.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他真正需要的就是好好睡觉，补充点B族维生素——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All he really needs is some good sleep and some B vitamins --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.21,0:37:36.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}维生素？瑞秋，这是锂盐！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vitamims? Rachel, this is lithium!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.47,0:37:37.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能推荐或支持这么做——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I cannot recommend or endorse this --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.95,0:37:40.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你也不必。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.17,0:37:43.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我必须这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.04,0:37:45.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他遭遇的一切都是我的错……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything that has happened to him is my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.31,0:37:48.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不是的——……所以必须由我来弥补。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it's not --...so I need to be the one to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.14,0:37:51.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我爸想要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is what my dad wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.97,0:38:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃——嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um -- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.72,0:38:09.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩·金？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn King?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.42,0:38:10.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.72,0:38:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是菲奥娜吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.46,0:38:15.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.77,0:38:17.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞什么？你气色真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell? You look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.69,0:38:20.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我来吧，老兄。我来。过来吧。我不行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I got it, dude. I got it. Come here. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.21,0:38:22.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？太——你在这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?It's so -- What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.56,0:38:23.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么会在湾区？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you in the Bay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.00,0:38:26.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在卖我经营的一家VR公司。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm selling a V.R. company I was running.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.35,0:38:28.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听起来很高级。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That sounds fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.35,0:38:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这辈子到底都在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell have you been doing with your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.52,0:38:32.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没见你出来玩。你也不上社交媒体。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never see you out. You're not on social media.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.74,0:38:35.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是因为我在管节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's because I'm running the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.27,0:38:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道，我只是——我以为你现在会，你知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know I guess I just -- I just thought you'd be, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.62,0:38:39.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经在比佛利山庄的大办公室拐角房里了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in a big corner office in Beverly Hills by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.66,0:38:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}惊讶你还在前线拼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Surprised you're still in the trenches.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.41,0:38:45.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，我今天赚了900万。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, actually, I made $9 million today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.72,0:38:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Today?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.85,0:38:52.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你怎么不出去花掉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, why aren't you out spending it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.03,0:38:54.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.94,0:38:57.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道。给。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.99,0:39:01.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敬900万。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To $9 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.17,0:39:06.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，宝贝，我马上回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, babe, I'll be right home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.82,0:39:09.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，杰伊。嘿老兄。我得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Jay.Hey dude. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.26,0:39:11.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泽维尔给我准备了很晚的晚饭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Xavier has a very late dinner waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.44,0:39:13.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，所谓的男朋友，随便吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, the so-called boyfriend, love whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.39,0:39:15.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。但我需要更多可卡因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh-huh.But I need more cocaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.74,0:39:17.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.75,0:39:19.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那八分之一盎司本来够你用一个星期的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That eight ball was supposed to last you a week!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.88,0:39:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没撑住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.14,0:39:26.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这样真是要了我的命，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are killing me here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.58,0:39:28.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你马上就要成明星了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're about to be a star, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.54,0:39:30.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得让你戒毒戒酒、清醒过来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have got to get you clean and sober
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.46,0:39:34.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好撑起一档节目——一档大节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and ready to carry a show -- a huge show.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.07,0:39:36.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，我做不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, I cannot do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.07,0:39:38.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，过来。你干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, come here.What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.11,0:39:40.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干什么？放松。过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?Relax. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.81,0:39:46.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要更多神奇小粉末。你懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need more magic poof poof. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.73,0:39:49.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Alexi，老兄，我还有Xavier，这不行——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alexi, dude, I've got Xavier and this isn't --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.00,0:39:51.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.69,0:39:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我点东西，我就给你点东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You give me something, I give you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.70,0:39:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，老兄……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, dude...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.80,0:40:15.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，我们才算真正在露营。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now, we are really camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.94,0:40:19.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，说真的——我真的很喜欢你的小屋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, I really -- I really like your cabin, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.63,0:40:21.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉，就是个快塌的破棚子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it's a falling down crap shack,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.77,0:40:24.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我希望很快能把它买下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I'm hoping to buy it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.07,0:40:27.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我开车穿过俄勒冈。转过这个弯，我就——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was driving through Oregon. I turned this bend and I just --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.34,0:40:29.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也说不清——我就是知道我得待在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know -- I just, like, knew I had to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.91,0:40:35.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特别便宜，因为没电什么的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's super cheap 'cause there's no electricity or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.34,0:40:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，我是说，有口井……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but, I mean, there is a well...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.52,0:40:39.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，电我可以帮忙搞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I can help with electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.26,0:40:41.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.40,0:40:43.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以前手很巧的，你知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I used to be very handy, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.61,0:40:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这倒是个好消息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.45,0:40:52.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我们可以把你的陶艺工作室放到后面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe we could put your pottery studio out back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.93,0:40:54.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿意我跟你一起去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'd want me to come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.63,0:40:56.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.45,0:40:59.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得那会很不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it could be really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.41,0:41:01.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，对我们俩都好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.07,0:41:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想你开心，Rach。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want you to be happy, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.68,0:41:08.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很开心，爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.81,0:41:11.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的，我真的很开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.78,0:41:24.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要睡着了。得关机了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm falling asleep. I got to shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.22,0:41:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚安，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good night, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.92,0:41:31.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.84,0:41:34.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.38,0:41:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\i1\blur0.8\1c&H008AC0D9}♪ O0 C1 ♪
